\format{html}
\precision{10000}

\text{nom=randitem(Romain,Marie,Anthony,Cécile,Michel,Nathalie,Alain,
Anne,Bertrand,Denise)}
\matrix{donne=
120,135,40
125,140,44
130,145,47
135,150,51
140,155,54
145,160,57
150,170,60
155,175,65
160,180,70
165,185,75
170,190,80
175,195,85
180,200,90}
\text{ligne=randomrow(\donne)}
\text{n=item(1,\ligne)}
\text{p=item(2,\ligne)}
\text{l=item(3,\ligne)}
\integer{r=sqrt((\n+\p)^2+\l^2)}
          
\statement{<div class="wimscenter">
\draw{200,250}{
xrange -20,20
yrange -25,25
lines black,-20,0,0,0,0,-20,10,-20,10,0,20,0
circle 8,-18,20,black
filledcircle 8,-18,18,red
lines black,-4.5,8,-6,8,-6,14,-5,15,1,15,2,14,2,8,0.5,8
line -4.5,13.5,-4.5,0,black
line 0.3,13.5,0.3,0,black
lines black,-2.25,0,-2.25,9,-1.75,9,-1.75,0
circle -2,17,20,black
dline 0,17,7,-16,black
text black,5,0,medium,?
}
</div>
L'altezza di \nom è \(\n\ cm), il pozzo ha una profondità di \(\p\ cm)  e un diametro di \(\l\ cm). A quale distanza si trova il pallone da \nom (in \(cm) arrotondando all'unità) ? 
}

\answer{Distanza}{\r}{type=default}